{"id": 110015449, "slug": "remember-folks-banking-crises-are", "title": "Remember Folks, Banking Crises are *Deflationary*", "subtitle": "It doesn't pay to short dollars into a financial crisis", "post_date": "2023-03-22T15:50:17.305Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 913, "reaction_count": 6, "comment_count": 1, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 6}, "body_html": "<p>There\u2019s a meme going around that the end of the dollar is right around the corner.</p><p>That the emergency liquidity provision by the Fed to the banking system represents a restart of QE, and this time, we will print out way to infinity, and the dollar will be trashed faster than an SF VC can tweet the Fed when their bank is failing.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p>Most prominently, this bet.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/balajis/status/1636797265317867520?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;I will take that bet.\\nYou buy 1 BTC.\\nI will send $1M USD.\\nThis is ~40:1 odds as 1 BTC is worth ~$26k.\\nThe term is 90 days.\\nAll we need is a mutually agreed custodian who will still be there to settle this in the event of digital dollar devaluation.\\nIf someone knows how to do this\u2026 https://t.co/tcuBNd679T &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;balajis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Balaji&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Fri Mar 17 18:30:52 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/FrcSSYuagAAVevh.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/6Aav9KeJpe&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;I'll bet anyone $1 million dollars that the US does not enter hyperinflation&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;jdcmedlock&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;James Medlock&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:2810,&quot;like_count&quot;:12312,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>As a former options trader the irony of a 40:1 bet that lasts 90 days and HAS NO STRIKE OR TRIGGER PRICE is a bit too much here.  </p><p>As a former hedge fund manager, I wish I could make these kinds of bets all day.</p><p>Thing is Mr Balaji has a point.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/balajis/status/1636822077775941633?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Just as in 2008, the bankers lied.\\n\\nThis time, the central bankers, the banks, and the bank regulators have lied to all dollar holders and depositors.\\n\\nThis isn't your typical fractional reserve situation. The problem is that there isn't enough in the <a class=\\&quot;tweet-url\\&quot; href=\\&quot;https://archive.is/CtW1B\\&quot;>archive.is/CtW1B</a>\u2026 https://t.co/ucoN3PlxSU &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;balajis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Balaji&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Fri Mar 17 20:09:28 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/FrcnepDaYAA-bxE.png&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/5nnxaoW9db&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null},{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/Frcnfs8akAExKIh.png&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/5nnxaoW9db&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null},{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/Frcng5maIAA12ZS.png&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/5nnxaoW9db&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null},{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/FrcniLSaMAEtI0d.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/5nnxaoW9db&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:2600,&quot;like_count&quot;:8156,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>It\u2019s true, fractional reserve banking is inherently vulnerable to what we used to call a \u2018<a href=\"https://medium.com/snow-ventures/a-turn-in-thecapitalcycle-4fd0b6193579\">scramble for liquidity</a>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"357\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:357,&quot;width&quot;:595,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:61740,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KkFK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe22890fb-db0b-469a-8e7f-4ee0bfc003fb_595x357.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Thing is, noticing a thing, and understanding how it works (or will work in the future as conditions change) are very different things.  What looks like a bug to Mr. Balaji is actually a feature.  </p><p>Imagine you could take $100 of shiny rocks and use it to support $2000 of spending? </p><p>Now instead of having to go find $100 more of rocks to finance $100 of spending, you just need $5.  Not bad when rocks are in short supply.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png\" width=\"853\" height=\"624\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:624,&quot;width&quot;:853,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:57961,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yfBg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9d0d2bc4-8461-437f-a7dc-0b1dcec36a2a_853x624.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>So yes, the financial institutions that engage in this kind of behavior (call it leveraging or fractional reserve banking or just the modern financial system) are inherently vulnerable to \u2018runs.\u2019  Usually, the folks who have $2000 in the bank don\u2019t all need it at the same time, so why keep $2000 of rock lying around?</p><p>The problem occurs when all $2000 of deposits show up and ask for their money back.</p><p>Yes this is a problem, but it\u2019s in the \u201cso what\u201d that Mr. B \u2018gets his linkages wrong\u2019 (as we used to say at the old shop).</p><p>See, turns out, pretty much the only thing we can say for sure about bank runs (or deleveragings more broadly) is that they are <em><strong>deflationary</strong></em>.</p><p>Why?  Well, the process of deleveraging (and to a lesser extent monetary tightening) is one of <em><strong>destroying money.</strong></em></p><p>When $1000 of people ask for their money back, and the bank only has $100 of \u2018money\u2019 the bank is left with only two options.</p><ol><li><p>Ask other people for money to cover their liabilities, or </p></li><li><p>Sell assets.</p></li></ol><p>Problem with #1, is that if $1000 of folks are asking for their money back from your bank, they are probably asking other banks as well, and so it\u2019s kind of hard to find people willing to lend you money (especially at old rates) in the middle of a bank run.  Leaving us really with only one option: selling assets.</p><p>This drives down the prices of assets as liquidity leaves the system.</p><p>As a policymaker, this isn\u2019t a bug, its a feature!</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1638534710971228163?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;It\u2019s not the Fed\u2019s job to help you make money. \\n\\nIn fact, it\u2019s literally the opposite.\\n\\nTightening is the process of slowing / destroying the creation of money and credit.  The whole point is there\u2019s less money to go around so stop expecting a free lunch. \\n\\nAn inverted curve is\u2026 https://t.co/6LYL6Fojrd&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Wed Mar 22 13:34:52 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;A lot of people blame the Fed for screwing the banks who were riding the curve.  Let's look back. In dec 2021 they announced QT was coming.  3 months later 10 year yields had moved up 25 and were still at 1.75.  PLUS the fed provided exit liquidity for 3 months by continuing to\u2026 https://t.co/HazL8BE3Cw https://t.co/QKFUl6SL4i&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;dampedspring&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Andy Constan&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:3,&quot;like_count&quot;:15,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Looking at history of US inflation makes this even more clear.  </p><p>Of the ~20 or so deflationary episodes in the last 200 years of economic history, 15 were a direct result of a financial crisis.  In fact they used to be so common we just called them \u2018panics\u2019 and people expected them every 5-15 years.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png\" width=\"1387\" height=\"493\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:493,&quot;width&quot;:1387,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:70365,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j5f4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1998aedb-f4d3-4f5f-bc61-e6306732e887_1387x493.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>So, while we still don\u2019t know if \u2018this one is different\u2019 in terms of whether the stress in the banking system is truly systemic, what we CAN say is that if it is, it will be followed by <em>deflation</em> and not <em>inflation</em>.</p><p>Now, there is a caveat here, specifically the example from emerging economies where banking crises lead to capital flight, and the very underpinning of the currency come under attack.  This is the model that Balaji likely has in his head.</p><p>When you add in the moves from Saudi to sell oil in RMB, and ten the recent news that Russia will settle their trade in RMB, it\u2019s certainty looks like foreign global powers are doing their darndest to undermine the status of the dollar as the global reserve currency.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/amasad/status/1637969728483520512?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;This feels bigger than GPT-4 &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;amasad&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Amjad Masad \u2815&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Tue Mar 21 00:09:49 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/Frs8yTXaEAA6gGF.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/5ONSEkwgCM&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:198,&quot;like_count&quot;:2444,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>What these folks miss out on, is not only are the vast majority of <a href=\"https://data.imf.org/?sk=E6A5F467-C14B-4AA8-9F6D-5A09EC4E62A4\">global reserve</a>s still in dollars\u2026</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png\" width=\"519\" height=\"442\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:442,&quot;width&quot;:519,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:27109,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fWwh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6b2a273-5d34-463f-b051-f2f5c31eac12_519x442.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>But so is the VAST majority of emerging market debt.  (Note we\u2019re moving fast here and so this need updating).</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lWdz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png\" width=\"922\" height=\"583\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/059da082-9bfb-4d44-88a3-d6033604a7fb_922x583.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:583,&quot;width&quot;:922,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;byte